| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **bind()** | Creates new function with bound `this` |
| **Partial application** | Can preset arguments |
| **Returns** | New function (doesn't invoke) |
| **`new` behavior** | Bound `this` is ignored |
| **Key method** | `apply()` or `call()` internally |

