## 🧾 Summary Table

| Pattern   | Purpose                                |
| --------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Module    | Encapsulate and organize code          |
| Observer  | Notify subscribers of changes          |
| Factory   | Create objects flexibly                |
| Builder   | Construct complex objects step-by-step |
| Singleton | Ensure single shared instance          |
